{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21798","headline":"有鸟二十章 十二 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟名老乌，贪痴突誖天下无。\n田中攫肉吞不足，偏入诸巢探衆雏。\n归来仍占主人树，腹饱巢高声响麤。\n山鵶野鹊闲受肉，凤皇不得闻罪辜。\n秋鹰掣断架上索，利爪一挥毛血落。\n可怜鵶鹊慕腥羶，犹向巢边竞纷泊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}